WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.600
Sit with the right leg extended and the left foot against the right inner thigh.

2
00:00:01.600 --> 00:00:03.200
Inhale and raise the left arm; exhale and side-bend over the right leg.

3
00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:04.800
Hold the right foot with the right hand; left arm reaches over the ear toward the foot.

4
00:00:04.800 --> 00:00:06.400
Rotate the chest gently upward and breathe into the left waist.

5
00:00:06.400 --> 00:00:08.000
Rise on an inhale and switch sides.
